From: HackMeGG <58815983+HackMeGG@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Backport legacy Scene detection code

Adapted for the OneUI 7 standard/mass Camera apps in ExtremeROM from:
https://github.com/salvogiangri/UN1CA/commit/ec9e5c1abda401d32d72e962ae6d2fd0d5abf31a

OneUI 7 sends text detection from MakerCallbackManager in both variants.
Use its sceneDetectionInfo key (F0) and feature 24 to choose between HAL
metadata and the legacy SceneDetectionNode callbacks. Query the cached
available-features array directly to avoid variant-specific helper classes.
Scenes 2 and 39 enable OCR; missing/short metadata disables it. Preserve
callback change detection, logging and reset scene state for a new maker.

---
diff --git a/smali_classes3/com/samsung/android/camera/core2/maker/MakerCallbackManager.smali b/smali_classes3/com/samsung/android/camera/core2/maker/MakerCallbackManager.smali
